        <briefdescription>
<para>Obtain the Load Address of a section by <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_section_ref" kindref="compound">SectionRef</ref>. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Calculate the address of the given section. The section need not be present in the local address space. The addresses need to be consistent with the addresses used to query the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_d_i_context" kindref="compound">DIContext</ref> and the output of this function should be deterministic, i.e. repeated calls with the same Sec should give the same address. </para>
